  "description": "OpenID Connect client base for Lyo.Authentication. Implements the BFF login flow used by Google and Keycloak adapters: OIDC discovery, JWKS cache, PKCE/state/nonce generation, /token exchange, id_token validation, and the external-login coordinator that maps an external login to a Lyo user + linked identity and mints a Lyo JWT.",
